Homebrew
----------
(1) FluxMarkdown
(2) ModernCSV

brew install --cask flux-markdown
brew install --cask modern-csv

Note: They will automatically show up in the Applications folder (--cask means it installs an application like you would from an internet browser, excluding --cask is for when you want to install a command line tool for terminal use).

